  "policy": "A campfire permit may be issued only for the lakeside or the meadow pitch group. During a fire watch warning, no campfire permits may be issued at all, and existing permits must be mentioned as suspended when a guest asks about them. Late checkout is granted for free when the pitch was unreachable due to flooding; otherwise the late fee of 15 per hour applies. Each vehicle staying overnight must be registered, and a pitch may hold at most two vehicles.",
